 "remarks": "Discover the charm and privacy of 205 Mountain Road in Wilton! This ranch-style home is set on approximately 1.60 acres, offering a peaceful, lightly wooded setting with plenty of room to enjoy the outdoors. The home features convenient one-level living, a screened-in porch, private well, and private septic system. Its inviting layout provides a comfortable setting with opportunities to make the space your own. Enjoy the tranquility of a natural setting while remaining conveniently located near Route 7, shopping, dining, and local amenities. Whether you're looking for privacy, convenience, or a place to call home, this property offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy all that Wilton has to offer. Schedule your showing today!",
